c92fdf1a81cf8c494f3d96b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mirko Brodesser \u003cmbrodesser@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1584170: part 2) Replace array with `AutoTArray`. r=hsivonen, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D48321", "files": ["dom/base/nsPlainTextSerializer.cpp", "dom/base/nsPlainTextSerializer.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "4b95348b577e6ced4227cdf0f576d702abec60f5", "parents": ["1bcfb098011f5dbfe5ba30fc3b1df3cf93812729"], "tags": []}], "date": 1572627094, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null, null, null], "user": "archaeopteryx@coole-files.de"}, "529": {"changesets": [{"author": "Philip Chimento \u003cphilip.chimento@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1590845 - Add JS::MemoryUse::Embedding1 through 5. r=tcampbell,jonco a=RyanVM\nThis makes JS::AddAssociatedMemory() and JS::RemoveAssociatedMemory()\nmore useful for embedders.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D50347", "files": ["js/public/MemoryFunctions.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "fdf55403f16c3218e7882ef352ff89928facff94", "parents": ["4b95348b577e6ced4227cdf0f576d702abec60f5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Philip Chimento \u003cphilip.chimento@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1426865 - Add -Wno-attributes to GCC builds. r=jwalden,dmajor a=RyanVM\n\nThis suppresses the warning for GCC builds that was previously suppressed\nby the JS_BROKEN_GCC_ATTRIBUTE_WARNING macro.\n\nDepends on D49099\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D49230", "files": ["js/src/js-cxxflags.mozbuild"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "76b74f9a0b12d0306922efaeb1d5a2e4e5b53414", "parents": ["fdf55403f16c3218e7882ef352ff89928facff94"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Philip Chimento \u003cphilip.chimento@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1426865 - Don't forward-declare JSContext and JSObject in RecordReplay. r=sfink a=RyanVM\nHave the public interface just use void* pointers so that we don't have to\nworry about symbol visibility.\n\n(Includes some reformatting of a macro because clang-format required it)\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D49097", "files": ["mfbt/RecordReplay.cpp", "mfbt/RecordReplay.h", "toolkit/recordreplay/WeakPointer.cpp", "toolkit/recordreplay/ipc/JSControl.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "5f56908fcf739327d896f84810b305a6f57deaf1", "parents": ["76b74f9a0b12d0306922efaeb1d5a2e4e5b53414"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Philip Chimento \u003cphilip.chimento@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1426865 - Remove JS_BROKEN_GCC_ATTRIBUTE_WARNING. r=sfink a=RyanVM\nThis macro makes any forward declarations unnecessarily verbose, and the\nbuild system uses Clang by default anyway, except in the hazard analysis\nwhich already specified -Wno-attributes.\n\nDepends on D49097\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D49098", "files": ["js/public/GCAPI.h", "js/public/ProfilingStack.h", "js/public/PropertyDescriptor.h", "js/src/jstypes.h", "js/src/vm/Stack.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "41d19cabb26a5074cf724dd4d832a1c1869a7ceb", "parents": ["5f56908fcf739327d896f84810b305a6f57deaf1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Philip Chimento \u003cphilip.chimento@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1426865 - Add default visibility to JSAPI symbols. r=sfink a=RyanVM\nDepends on D49098\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D49099", "files": ["js/public/ArrayBuffer.h", "js/public/Class.h", "js/public/CompilationAndEvaluation.h", "js/public/CompileOptions.h", "js/public/ContextOptions.h", "js/public/Date.h", "js/public/Equality.h", "js/public/ErrorReport.h", "js/public/ForOfIterator.h", "js/public/GCAPI.h", "js/public/HashTable.h", "js/public/JSON.h", "js/public/LocaleSensitive.h", "js/public/MemoryFunctions.h", "js/public/OffThreadScriptCompilation.h", "js/public/PropertyDescriptor.h", "js/public/PropertySpec.h", "js/public/RealmOptions.h", "js/public/RegExp.h", "js/public/SavedFrameAPI.h", "js/public/SharedArrayBuffer.h", "js/public/Symbol.h", "js/public/Transcoding.h", "js/public/TypeDecls.h", "js/public/Value.h", "js/public/Vector.h", "js/public/Warnings.h", "js/public/experimental/SourceHook.h", "js/src/builtin/Object.h", "js/src/frontend/BinASTTokenReaderContext.h", "js/src/frontend/BytecodeCompilation.h", "js/src/frontend/BytecodeSection.h", "js/src/frontend/LabelEmitter.h", "js/src/frontend/TokenStream.h", "js/src/gc/FreeOp.h", "js/src/gc/WeakMap.h", "js/src/jsapi.h", "js/src/threading/ProtectedData.h", "js/src/util/CompleteFile.h", "js/src/util/StructuredSpewer.h", "js/src/vm/BigIntType.h", "js/src/vm/EqualityOperations.h", "js/src/vm/ModuleBuilder.h", "js/src/vm/TypeSet.h", "js/src/wasm/AsmJS.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "f1900e751baba38e158a9156d6bbd4d401d06ac5", "parents": ["41d19cabb26a5074cf724dd4d832a1c1869a7ceb"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Marco Bonardo \u003cmbonardo@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1573753 - Copy the urlbar value when pageproxystate is invalid and there's no result. r=adw a=RyanVM\n\nWhen copying from the input field, when the value has already been confirmed\nby the user (either by picking a result or Enter), we cannot use the selected\nresult information, because it has already been cleared by _loadURL setting\nthe value to the final one.\nIf the page already finished loading, pageproxystate is valid and we can use\ncurrentURI, but if the page takes a long time to load, or the load is canceled,\nwe need a fallback, because we don't want to interrupt the copy operation.\n\nIn this case, the current value can be either a valid url or a search string.\nIf it's a valid url, we can just go through the usual URI handling, trying to\nmake it nicer. After all, we'd do the same just after the page is done loading.\nOtherwise, we fallback to the currently selected value.\n\nThis works also if the user is still in the process of selecting a result\nand tries to copy from the input field, because on result selection we set\neither a valid url or a non-url.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D50832", "files": ["browser/components/urlbar/UrlbarInput.jsm", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/browser/browser.ini", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/browser/browser_urlbar_copy_during_load.js", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/browser/slow-page.sjs"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "1d19aac2305607b074ea116d9da3f060fdff54f4", "parents": ["f1900e751baba38e158a9156d6bbd4d401d06ac5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Karl Tomlinson \u003ckarlt+@karlt.net\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1592502 initialize all fields of GdkEvents r=stransky a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D51051", "files": ["widget/gtk/nsClipboardX11.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "eda9ff031d24a7bb11206709233184c314c9b897", "parents": ["1d19aac2305607b074ea116d9da3f060fdff54f4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Junior Hsu \u003cjuhsu@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1580288, r=mayhemer a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D47831", "files": ["netwerk/protocol/http/nsHttpTransaction.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "97bca4363e015a7dbde22c364ad1e6800f7846df", "parents": ["eda9ff031d24a7bb11206709233184c314c9b897"], "tags": []}], "date": 1572633093, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null], "user": "archaeopteryx@coole-files.de"}, "530": {"changesets": [{"author": "Sebastian Hengst \u003carchaeopteryx@coole-files.de\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Backed out changeset 1d19aac23056 (bug 1573753) for failing added browser_urlbar_copy_during_load.js. a=backout", "files": ["browser/components/urlbar/UrlbarInput.jsm", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/browser/browser.ini", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/browser/browser_urlbar_copy_during_load.js", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/browser/slow-page.sjs"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "584b998c3ad2355541e19aaba28678e7000e8c4b", "parents": ["97bca4363e015a7dbde22c364ad1e6800f7846df"], "tags": []}], "date": 1572638327, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "archaeopteryx@coole-files.de"}, "531": {"changesets": [{"author": "L10n Bumper Bot \u003crelease+l10nbumper@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "no bug - Bumping Fennec l10n changesets r=release a=l10n-bump DONTBUILD\n\ncs -\u003e 87e78d46f08e\nen-GB -\u003e 5cc18fc7b49e\neo -\u003e 85cd5c1d54dc\nes-MX -\u003e 745eac81a574\nfy-NL -\u003e 75986818776c\nhy-AM -\u003e fa3c15737912\nit -\u003e 93a46175e018\nmr -\u003e 6fd743d0c02a\nnb-NO -\u003e 0eb46fbb0ce3\nnl -\u003e 0c0dc45b7b47\nsk -\u003e 146bff449631\nsv-SE -\u003e c80d4a6812e6\nuk -\u003e 39b74fc365a3\nzh-CN -\u003e 359979d2d4e7", "files": ["mobile/locales/l10n-changesets.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "adc5bd968310896a343bf6268dd8c6cd763f0f9e", "parents": ["584b998c3ad2355541e19aaba28678e7000e8c4b"], "tags": []}], "date": 1572678029, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "532": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mihai Tabara \u003cmtabara@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1588590 - switch Fennec betas to use GCP workers. r=jlorenzo a=release", "files": ["taskcluster/ci/push-apk/kind.yml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "31c662e7ee8b7d583c05c4ac0f9fb8f9ce21904d", "parents": ["adc5bd968310896a343bf6268dd8c6cd763f0f9e"], "tags": []}], "date": 1572860991, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "mtabara@mozilla.com"}, "533": {"changesets": [{"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1218456 - Prevent navigating away in test_overlay.html. r=zbraniecki a=pascalc\n\nI'm not sure why the test structure is the way it is, but without this and with\nthe changes from this bug  we start navigating away which means we try to reach\nmozilla.org, which is forbidden in automation since non-local connections are,\ncausing the failures that got me backed out in comment 25.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D37469", "files": ["intl/l10n/test/dom/test_domloc_overlay.html"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "fadf81d7d16e2293ea3f9f064a8a7e30ed854809", "parents": ["31c662e7ee8b7d583c05c4ac0f9fb8f9ce21904d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1218456 - Document::GetContainer shouldn't be virtual. r=smaug a=pascalc\n\nIt's never overridden. Also chances are we should remove it and just use\nGetDocShell().\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D37405", "files": ["dom/base/Document.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "4fbc7ac047148c2386a287d35e98a10351249ef3", "parents": ["fadf81d7d16e2293ea3f9f064a8a7e30ed854809"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1218456 - Allow navigating when there's no pres context. r=smaug a=pascalc\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D37404", "files": ["dom/base/Document.cpp", "dom/base/Document.h", "dom/base/Element.cpp", "dom/base/nsContentUtils.cpp", "dom/base/nsContentUtils.h", "dom/html/HTMLAnchorElement.cpp", "dom/html/nsGenericHTMLElement.cpp", "dom/svg/SVGAElement.cpp", "editor/libeditor/HTMLEditor.cpp", "editor/libeditor/HTMLEditor.h", "layout/base/PresShell.cpp", "layout/base/nsDocumentViewer.cpp", "layout/base/nsPresContext.cpp", "layout/base/nsPresContext.h", "layout/generic/nsImageFrame.cpp", "testing/web-platform/meta/content-security-policy/inheritance/blob-url-in-main-window-self-navigate-inherits.sub.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/html/semantics/links/following-hyperlinks/activation-behavior.window.js.ini"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "d866e8ed6eb281ceb11332ee8f99aa86bd0bd209", "parents": ["4fbc7ac047148c2386a287d35e98a10351249ef3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1218456 - Remove nsILinkHandler. r=smaug a=pascalc\n\nInterfaces with just one implementation don't seem very useful.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D37406", "files": ["docshell/base/moz.build", "docshell/base/nsDocShell.cpp", "docshell/base/nsDocShell.h", "docshell/base/nsILinkHandler.h", "dom/base/Element.cpp", "dom/base/Element.h", "dom/base/FragmentOrElement.cpp", "dom/base/nsINode.cpp", "dom/html/HTMLFormElement.cpp", "dom/html/HTMLFormSubmission.cpp", "dom/plugins/base/nsPluginInstanceOwner.cpp", "editor/libeditor/HTMLEditor.cpp", "layout/base/nsDocumentViewer.cpp", "layout/base/nsPresContext.h", "layout/xul/nsImageBoxFrame.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "a7b2ca3b03c30520de5e0929fc551d22d1b48c60", "parents": ["d866e8ed6eb281ceb11332ee8f99aa86bd0bd209"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1218456 - Simplify CheckHandleEventForAnchorsPreconditions. r=smaug a=pascalc\n\nI've checked that this doesn't change behavior in the test-case for bug 30178,\nwhich is just an imagemap inside a link.\n\nOverall it'd be weird if we needed this for area-inside-a but not for stuff like\nnested links.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D37407", "files": ["dom/html/nsGenericHTMLElement.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "160054b48c93cf170ee5d55039b60a367a086a08", "parents": ["a7b2ca3b03c30520de5e0929fc551d22d1b48c60"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Bryce Seager van Dyk \u003cbvandyk@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1587543 - Bump OpenH264 fallback downloader to 1.8.1.1. r=Callek a=pascalc\n\nThis change will cause Firefox to re-download the OpenH264 GMP if it already has\nthe 1.8.1 version. This is being done to mitigate and issue where clients that\nalready downloaded that version on previous versions of Firefox did not clear\nthe mac quarantine attribute that prevents the lib being loaded in MacOS\nCatalina.\n\nNewer versions of Firefox will clear the attribute on download, so we want to\ntrigger a re-download by those clients. We would typically expect this to be\ndone by balrog, but we update these fallback rules to cover the edge case where\nbalrog is not available and in order to keep these rules in step with those on\nbalrog.\n\nThe binaries pointed to by this 1.8.1.1 version are the same as the 1.8.1\nversion. This change is solely to trigger a re-download.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D49197", "files": ["toolkit/content/gmp-sources/openh264.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "cf06c61df5b3da0957cb1fc80c91115867edb94d", "parents": ["160054b48c93cf170ee5d55039b60a367a086a08"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mark Banner \u003cstandard8@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1589972 - Don't stop tracking search telemetry when the location change is for the same document. r=mikedeboer a=pascalc\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D49949", "files": ["browser/components/search/test/browser/browser_searchTelemetry.js", "browser/modules/BrowserUsageTelemetry.jsm"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "94d5c2a0f063415abed8348740cdf3ce77fe9b59", "parents": ["cf06c61df5b3da0957cb1fc80c91115867edb94d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mark Banner \u003cstandard8@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1589972 - When an unrelated document loads, don't clear out search telemetry information for other documents. r=mikedeboer, a=pascalc\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D49950", "files": ["browser/components/search/SearchTelemetry.jsm", "browser/components/search/test/browser/browser_searchTelemetry.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "2bc9b2075e5a630586add12ac8a44cbab2e60e25", "parents": ["94d5c2a0f063415abed8348740cdf3ce77fe9b59"], "tags": []}], "date": 1572864314, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null], "user": "archaeopteryx@coole-files.de"}, "534": {"changesets": [{"author": "L10n Bumper Bot \u003crelease+l10nbumper@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "no bug - Bumping Fennec l10n changesets r=release a=l10n-bump DONTBUILD\n\nbe -\u003e 2ffb590b4441\nbn -\u003e d4a41b514ddd\ncak -\u003e 2de579f7d72e\ncs -\u003e ec9bc87b4b79\nda -\u003e c3c17a3c4917\neo -\u003e 69eb0b3a8287\nes-CL -\u003e 66e7b17671f3\nes-ES -\u003e 08a488b1303e\nfi -\u003e ed5cb34bcf6a\nhe -\u003e a4c8df7d7cb7\nit -\u003e da854fe5f67e\nka -\u003e 5211528d7c2c\nkk -\u003e b679929afc94\nlt -\u003e 7605049c23f4\nnl -\u003e 3e3df6a9035a\nru -\u003e 4eedb7ee2dcf\nth -\u003e 80ac581c72e5\nuz -\u003e bb16fd017756\nzh-CN -\u003e 0ed7e496e1fd\nzh-TW -\u003e 0d32399e4d26", "files": ["mobile/locales/l10n-changesets.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "fc08cc0212a87432887da1614bb532c501866929", "parents": ["2bc9b2075e5a630586add12ac8a44cbab2e60e25"], "tags": []}], "date": 1572868830, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "535": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr68 repo-update HSTS HPKP blocklist remote-settings - a=repo-update r=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D51602", "files": ["browser/app/blocklist.xml", "security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons.json", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/plugins.json", "services/settings/dumps/main/hijack-blocklists.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "1fec38d230434d5f95be709cf69c353526cdc4e0", "parents": ["fc08cc0212a87432887da1614bb532c501866929"], "tags": ["FENNEC_68_3b3_BUILD1", "FENNEC_68_3b3_RELEASE"]}], "date": 1572875987, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "536": {"changesets": [{"author": "L10n Bumper Bot \u003crelease+l10nbumper@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "no bug - Bumping Fennec l10n changesets r=release a=l10n-bump DONTBUILD\n\neu -\u003e 45e384e8f064\nuk -\u003e ffbaf9f663bd", "files": ["mobile/locales/l10n-changesets.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "c7c30e7975fe5b3b4bcb4f17a4f651180b189de8", "parents": ["1fec38d230434d5f95be709cf69c353526cdc4e0"], "tags": []}], "date": 1572883252, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "537": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mozilla Releng Treescript \u003crelease+treescript@mozilla.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug - Tagging 1fec38d230434d5f95be709cf69c353526cdc4e0 with FENNEC_68_3b3_BUILD1 a=release CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "b8bff98e1d67aa9127e044ccd2995885c4b7bdc0", "parents": ["c7c30e7975fe5b3b4bcb4f17a4f651180b189de8"], "tags": []}], "date": 1572885214, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "538": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jorg K \u003cjorgk@jorgk.com\u003e", "branch": "THUNDERBIRD_68_VERBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 1593540 - Follow-up to bug 1587067: Check install path match before trying to match x86 path. r=mossop a=jorgk DONTBUILD\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D51534", "files": ["toolkit/profile/nsToolkitProfileService.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "efd27abec3b809b9c0de3ddf5aa65ada5df83d85", "parents": ["6c8f184ddf35eabab4101515f3698b93b0940788"], "tags": []}], "date": 1572953128, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "mozilla@jorgk.com"}, "539": {"changesets": [{"author": "Marco Bonardo \u003cmbonardo@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1573753 - Copy the urlbar value when pageproxystate is invalid and there's no result. r=adw a=RyanVM\n\nWhen copying from the input field, when the value has already been confirmed\nby the user (either by picking a result or Enter), we cannot use the selected\nresult information, because it has already been cleared by _loadURL setting\nthe value to the final one.\nIf the page already finished loading, pageproxystate is valid and we can use\ncurrentURI, but if the page takes a long time to load, or the load is canceled,\nwe need a fallback, because we don't want to interrupt the copy operation.\n\nIn this case, the current value can be either a valid url or a search string.\nIf it's a valid url, we can just go through the usual URI handling, trying to\nmake it nicer. After all, we'd do the same just after the page is done loading.\nOtherwise, we fallback to the currently selected value.\n\nThis works also if the user is still in the process of selecting a result\nand tries to copy from the input field, because on result selection we set\neither a valid url or a non-url.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D50832", "files": ["browser/components/urlbar/UrlbarInput.jsm", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/browser/browser.ini", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/browser/browser_urlbar_copy_during_load.js", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/browser/slow-page.sjs"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "3bade4adecfdb654e2a912355b0627365b681551", "parents": ["b8bff98e1d67aa9127e044ccd2995885c4b7bdc0"], "tags": []}], "date": 1572960808, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "archaeopteryx@coole-files.de"}, "540": {"changesets": [{"author": "Aaron Amanuel \u003caamanuel@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1574243 - Duplicate bouncerscript submission task to point at Nazgul. r=mtabara\n\nDuplicating the old bouncer submission task and having it point to Nazgul in both stage and prod.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D42171", "files": ["taskcluster/docs/kinds.rst"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "09391cfdf11ae80c827f4a073ddfc3f322ef0651", "parents": ["3bade4adecfdb654e2a912355b0627365b681551"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nick Thomas \u003cnthomas@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1585603 - enable GCP addonworkers. r=catlee a=release\n\nSwitch addonworkers from AWS to GCP.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D48025", "files": ["taskcluster/ci/release-sign-and-push-langpacks/kind.yml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "106383a3bb65f52719e056888726ceb8926aedfe", "parents": ["09391cfdf11ae80c827f4a073ddfc3f322ef0651"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mihai Tabara \u003cmtabara@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1580478 - enable GCP balrogworkers.r=catlee a=release\n\nSwitch balrogworkers from AWS to GCP\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D47606", "files": ["taskcluster/ci/config.yml", "taskcluster/taskgraph/util/workertypes.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "2435140d1dc4e8c04df6356d1e91f495118e19ce", "parents": ["106383a3bb65f52719e056888726ceb8926aedfe"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mihai Tabara \u003cmtabara@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1588577 - switch to new GCP pushsnapworkers. r=nthomas a=release\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D49183", "files": ["taskcluster/ci/release-secondary-snap-push/kind.yml", "taskcluster/ci/release-snap-push/kind.yml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "0e35519e2e7ff77a7a3599f914e4407d1db28e27", "parents": ["2435140d1dc4e8c04df6356d1e91f495118e19ce"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nick Thomas \u003cnthomas@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1588392 - Switch to new GCP treescript workers, r=mtabara a=release\n\nDifferential Rev