"branch": "default", "desc": "no bug - Bumping Fennec l10n changesets r=release a=l10n-bump DONTBUILD\n\nbr -\u003e 08c02a59e6d0\nen-CA -\u003e de11a3354e9e\neo -\u003e 19863f076557\nfr -\u003e 046e3d5ba03f\nhe -\u003e bf57d19e1a8e\nko -\u003e 7e491bd663c4\nmr -\u003e 4973455de49e\nzh-TW -\u003e 53e1b207e308", "files": ["mobile/locales/l10n-changesets.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "e880754b921f462dfddd6245309639a35f685db0", "parents": ["96f32a147cbf53373f82d22911d2a9ed996bab64"], "tags": []}], "date": 1573135233, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "550": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr68 repo-update HSTS HPKP blocklist remote-settings - a=repo-update r=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D52152", "files": ["browser/app/blocklist.xml", "security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "64ca9e5ce313d1437d04bc113e005dcd56fc0afe", "parents": ["e880754b921f462dfddd6245309639a35f685db0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tom Ritter \u003ctom@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1575974 - Restrict pingsender to an allowlist of destination hosts. r=chutten,gsvelto, a=RyanVM\n\nSometimes curl doesn't have the url parsing function we would like to use.\nIn order to not fail open (and have tests work on all platforms) we roll\nour own url parsing function. (Ew.)\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D44046", "files": ["toolkit/components/telemetry/pingsender/pingsender.cpp", "toolkit/components/telemetry/pingsender/pingsender.h", "toolkit/components/telemetry/pingsender/pingsender_unix_common.cpp", "toolkit/components/telemetry/pingsender/pingsender_win.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "5dfbcf9e2c935cf4d5282f0b132a95355023d56a", "parents": ["64ca9e5ce313d1437d04bc113e005dcd56fc0afe"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tom Ritter \u003ctom@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1575974 - Add tests for pingsender url parsing. r=gsvelto, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D44706", "files": ["toolkit/components/telemetry/app/TelemetrySend.jsm", "toolkit/components/telemetry/tests/unit/test_PingSender.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "adf225ac6141a64e596e80ce243a7c9f1ed925a9", "parents": ["5dfbcf9e2c935cf4d5282f0b132a95355023d56a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tom Ritter \u003ctom@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1575974 - Report any non-zero exit code as a process failure in nsIProcess. r=gsvelto, a=RyanVM\n\nEXIT_FAILURE is 'implementation defined' but can be defined to be 1.\nIn our case, pingsender exits with EXIT_FAILURE but nsIProcess wasn't\nreporting it as failure because it thought failures were always negative.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D45038", "files": ["toolkit/components/crashes/CrashService.jsm", "xpcom/tests/unit/test_nsIProcess.js", "xpcom/threads/nsProcessCommon.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "a3a7c1ecb80643568b0278faf2cae221ed11d6f3", "parents": ["adf225ac6141a64e596e80ce243a7c9f1ed925a9"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Bryce Seager van Dyk \u003cbvandyk@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1592371 - QueryDosDeviceWHook returns size of lpTargetPath copy on success. r=bobowen a=RyanVM\n\nPrior to the patch we appear to be returning the size of lpDeviceName rather\nthan lpTargetPath.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D50979", "files": ["dom/media/gmp/ChromiumCDMAdapter.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "5a57a0c182571a0c0be22e4f6db56e14adcb83f8", "parents": ["a3a7c1ecb80643568b0278faf2cae221ed11d6f3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Vlad Baicu \u003cvlad.baicu@softvi