kcluster-proxy for windows builds' tooltool access; r=Callek a=taskcluster-migration\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com//D52471", "files": ["taskcluster/ci/searchfox/kind.yml", "taskcluster/ci/static-analysis-autotest/kind.yml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "fe0748a768c313b43b4effbb9f667cfc145efd20", "parents": ["0fe12384763874c9cc66383c1f30a6da65535837"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tom Prince \u003cmozilla@hocat.ca\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1546801: [firefox-ci] Do not enable taskcluster proxy on g-w for non-internal tooltool downloads; r=dustin a=taskcluster-migration\n\ngeneric-worker uses localhost:8080 for the taskcluster proxy. Many jobs,\nincluding raptor also try to use that port. Disable using the proxy\nwhen only public tooltool downloads were requested, since this\nwas how thing were configured before.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com//D52478", "files": ["taskcluster/taskgraph/transforms/job/common.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "e52ab4749003b57cc213bca0458b65849d0425db", "parents": ["fe0748a768c313b43b4effbb9f667cfc145efd20"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tom Prince \u003cmozilla@hocat.ca\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1595368: [firefox-ci] Use internal tooltool downloads for windows spidermonkey tasks; r=garbas a=task-fix\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D52497", "files": ["taskcluster/ci/spidermonkey/linux.yml", "taskcluster/ci/spidermonkey/windows.yml", "taskcluster/taskgraph/transforms/job/spidermonkey.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "3a799aa45cb46cb9198c7f266cda1b1551bc79c7", "parents": ["e52ab4749003b57cc213bca0458b65849d0425db"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tom Prince \u003cmozilla@hocat.ca\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1595368: [firefox-ci] Use consitent logic to determine tooltool url; r=sfraser a=task-fix\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator