reForwarder during shutdown which may return a null pointer.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D51615", "files": ["gfx/layers/client/TextureClient.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "c384f2be41a76410a75ba3ef9c6fbe96aef4407d", "parents": ["234962fb9a22aaba57f34c0e8d751341665144e3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nicolas Silva \u003cnsilva@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1585760 - Check that GetTextureForwarder isn't null in more places. r=sotaro, a=lizzard\n\nDepends on D51615\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D51616", "files": ["gfx/layers/PersistentBufferProvider.cpp", "gfx/layers/client/CompositableClient.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "3be8bbbf737d65d942e43a147d92d7be404d18ac", "parents": ["c384f2be41a76410a75ba3ef9c6fbe96aef4407d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1597273 - Handle logical shorthand animations with variable references correctly. r=hiro, a=lizzard\n\nWhen we physicalize the declarations for @keyframes, we end up having a physical\ndeclaration with an unparsed value with `from_shorthand` being the logical\nshorthand.\n\nAccount for this case properly when substituting custom properties, to avoid\npanicking.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D53663", "files": ["servo/components/style/properties/data.py", "servo/components/style/properties/properties.mako.rs", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-logical/animation-001.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-logical/animation-002.html"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "ddcd96385569f5d703a6b65fb9bd40addef671e9", "parents": ["3be8bbbf737d65d942e43a147d92d7be404d18ac"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Petru Lingurar \u003cpetru.lingurar@softvision.ro\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1593322 - Allow the sign-in text to be as wide as the paren